{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261120/photo/bkn-20261120140058454-1120_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261120170648\"/><p>涉事英式迫擊砲彈。</p><p>深水埗發現懷疑炸彈。今午(20日)12時58分，興華街3號深水埗運動場對開一地盤的工人報案，指在上址發現酒樽型的懷疑炸彈。警員接報封鎖現場，發現一件二戰時期英式迫擊砲彈，長約24厘米，直徑約5厘米。爆炸品處理人員其後檢走該枚英式迫擊砲彈，並將其安全處理，現場亦獲准解封。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T09:26:24.254581+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":153,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T06:00:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T10:17:16.338971+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T09:19:44.225175+00:00","content_hash":"4d05659ea5f17ab0c5c7510900aa330153c71c845952035e920d28c09a90ad3e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T09:26:24.254581+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}